00:37:36,550 --> 00:37:38,950
So even when we want to do a prompting based solution,

299
00:37:38,950 --> 00:37:50,870
we start with some simple solution like say if you were to use elastic search you'll have term frequency inverse document frequency TF or BM25 based retrieval.

