00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:32,630
then again the best thing to do is to go back to encoder models and really train them and then use that to find the best matching products.

305
00:38:32,630 --> 00:38:37,910
Now there's a small subset of cases where generative AI models are useful and that is the cases

306
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:49,109
where we have a cold start situation where we don't have label data for some queries or for some new artifacts that have been added to our repository.

