00:39:24,150 --> 00:39:27,510
So this was for the first two buckets.

314
00:39:27,510 --> 00:39:33,270
Now the third one is generation where we only need world knowledge and tasks like summarization,

315
00:39:33,280 --> 00:39:40,870
persuasive copywriting or some simple image edits would fall into this category.

316
00:39:40,870 --> 00:39:43,030
Now most foundation models are trained very well.

317
00:39:43,030 --> 00:39:51,829
So the simplest and often the most effective thing to do is just smart prompting with these foundation models.

318
00:39:51,829 --> 00:40:02,310
And if we really want to optimize for latency, that is the only case when we want might choose to fine-tune our own custom models.

319
00:40:02,310 --> 00:40:07,510
Now the fourth bucket that I called out was the knowledge intensive generation.

