00:40:07,510 --> 00:40:17,349
And here we need uh deep domain knowledge because we need to ground this in facts and up-to-date information.

321
00:40:17,349 --> 00:40:24,710
And for this case the foundation models won't work well because they might hallucinate or they might respond with outdated info.

