00:40:24,720 --> 00:40:30,870
So the first cut solution itself is drag or retrieval augmented generation.

323
00:40:30,870 --> 00:40:36,790
So here the system would retrieve some relevant information from a database and

324
00:40:36,800 --> 00:40:47,910
then you know feed just that relevant bit of information to the generative model which will generate the final response

325
00:40:47,910 --> 00:40:58,630
and again you know as you get more propriety data you know you can and you have more capacity to fine-tune models one can choose to fine-tune domain specific solution.

