00:41:15,270 --> 00:41:22,870
and knowledge intensive generation we need to actually augment that generation with some retrieval and the complex path is of course

329
00:41:22,870 --> 00:41:35,750
to fine-tune our custom models which could be encoder based models models for the first two buckets and it would be generative models for the second two ones.

