00:43:03,680 --> 00:43:09,910
now invoke specialized models under the hood.

342
00:43:09,910 --> 00:43:15,990
Now once we have this set of candidate models there are two broad sets of considerations.

343
00:43:15,990 --> 00:43:30,470
The first set is qualitative factors and you should examine this up front because that will narrow the choices and it's like lower effort in general and then come the quantitative one which we validate through rigorous experiments.

