00:43:30,470 --> 00:43:35,349
So the qualitative ones mostly deal with governance,

345
00:43:35,349 --> 00:43:50,069
legal and operational factors and these include deciding whether we want open access models where we can see and fine-tune the parameters or closed ones like GPT where we can only access through an API.

