00:44:17,910 --> 00:44:31,270
We also need to evaluate the liabilities for copyright infringement and whether our particular usage scenario is approved or not like say retraining with the model output

351
00:44:31,270 --> 00:44:37,430
because that's not permitted by a lot of models like chart GPT and claude.

352
00:44:37,430 --> 00:44:40,069
Now in addition to these constraints,

353
00:44:40,069 --> 00:44:51,510
we also need to look at computation cost and throughput limits to see if they fit the application needs because there might be an application latency and there might be an application budget.

