00:58:26,710 --> 00:58:35,910
you know the nature of the application we need to make a dynamic plan then you need a planner and if you need a lot of different tools like sometimes

466
00:58:35,910 --> 00:58:50,870
you want to answer a knowledge intensive question sometimes you want to solve a math problem sometimes you want to generate an image then you would need a whole variety of tools and all of this additional coordination effort does answer the query you had.

