00:59:14,950 --> 00:59:28,470
Is that something that is going to be carried out by one of these specialist tools or do we need to do something about that outside of the LLM based application right and validation is definitely very very important

472
00:59:28,480 --> 00:59:38,710
because these gen systems are stochastic and unpredictable so we really need a multi-layered defense

