00:59:38,710 --> 00:59:50,069
and like I called out there would be some of these safety tools right safety or compliance tool and these are actually spread across different layers.

474
00:59:50,069 --> 01:00:00,710
So first you start with input validation right so this layer ensures that the user query or the context stays within the scope of the system.

